    "darkNote": {
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1760,
      "w": 460,
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": "m",
      "page": "dark-en",
      "text": "These screens are the same files as the 浅色 · 中文 page, shown with theme = dark and locale = en. Edit a screen on the first page and it changes here too.\n\nDark palette: warm near-black grounds (#1B1B1A editor, #262625 chrome), text #ECECE8, secondary #A6A69F. The accent is lifted to #8AA6F2, and text on accent-colored buttons is picked automatically from the accent's brightness."
    },
    "titleWin": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "text": "Lastab — Windows",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3760,
      "page": "windows"
    },
    "winNote": {
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1760,
      "w": 460,
      "fill": "teal",
      "size": "m",
      "page": "windows",
      "text": "同一批画板，platform = win：\n\n· 窗口按钮在右上（最小化 / 最大化 / 关闭），左侧不再留红黄绿。\n· 快捷键写成文字：Ctrl+Shift+C、Esc、Enter、Alt，而不是 ⌘⇧⌥ 符号。\n· 版本历史用 Ctrl+Shift+Y，Ctrl+Y 留给「重做」。\n· 命令行路径改为 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Lastab\\bin\\lastab.exe。\n· 「最近」切换器同样弹出后用 Tab 切换；Windows 上没有 ⌘` 那样的系统冲突，所以设置里的说明不同。"
    }
